      "rationale": "This follows the agreed contract without introducing a required deployment-specific base URL setting.",
      "alternatives": [
        "Require a public base URL property, rejected because it adds configuration and is not required.",
        "Hard-code localhost, rejected because returned URLs would be incorrect for other hosts and ports."
